-- twow-repo#295 W2b mount spells (main train 9), owner decisions 2026-10-02 (#295, CLI-295):
--   Mounted speed is chosen by the server, only for players and bots: family 1 (slow mounts)
--   +60/+100/+100/+100 %, family 2 (swift) +60/+100/+140/+180 % by riding rank 1..4; rank 0
--   keeps level/2; SPELL_CUSTOM_MOUNT_SPEED_100 spells are family 2 with a floor of 100;
--   SPELL_CUSTOM_IGNORE_RIDING_SKILL_MOUNT_SPEED (racing cars) unchanged. NPCs are never affected.
--   The server reads the family from the mount spell's own aura-32 value (>= 100 -> family 2).
--   "The 12 riding-75 items whose spell is +100 (12353, 12354, 13329, 30001, 30019, 50426,
--   51249, 80459, 80460, 80461, 80462, 83520 - incl. the Goblin and High Elf racial mounts) get
--   their mount spell's aura-32 basepoint set to 59 (+60), coupled server+client, after checking
--   no NPC uses the spell."
-- 1. Aura-32 value 100 -> 60 (effectBasePoints2 99 -> 59, dice 1) on their 11 mount spells
--    (collection_mount): 12353 -> 16083, 12354 -> 16082, 13329 -> 17460, 30001 -> 33401,
--    30019 -> 33419, 50426 -> 46446, 51249 -> 46452, 80459 -> 45049, 80460 -> 45050,
--    80461 -> 45052, 80462 -> 45051, 83520 -> 16083. 16082 is also the spell of 16339
--    Commander's Steed (riding 150, not obtainable), which 20261002211000 leaves unchanged.
--    NPC check per ID (01.10 dump + 814): creature_template spell_id1-4, spawn_spell_id and
--    auras, creature_addon auras, creature_spells 1-8, the creature_ai, creature_movement,
--    creature_spells, event, gameobject, generic, gossip, quest_start, quest_end and spell
--    scripts (cast, add/remove aura, cooldown), gameobject traps/goobers/rituals/spellcasters,
--    pet_spell_data, petcreateinfo_spell: no hit. git grep (src, modules): 16082 only as an
--    item entry in the bot item lists (PlayerbotFactory.cpp, RandomItemMgr.cpp). The only users
--    are the collection items above. Table: builds/cli295-riding/evidence/manifest/npc-usage-295.tsv.
-- 2. The buff text of every player mount spell (aura 78 at effect 1, with an aura 32, without
--    IGNORE_RIDING) names the speeds of its family after step 1: 205 family 1,
--    246 + 1 family 2 (46538 keeps its second line), 13 SPEED_100 (+100 % up to riding 150).
--    Old texts: 'Speed scales with your Riding skill.' and 'Increases speed based on your Riding
--    skill.' (same meaning). Unchanged: the rentals 40700-40711 and the riding turtle 30174
--    (own texts), the racing cars 50061/50062, and 3363, 26332, 47036, 52250 (no aura 32).
--    Text only: NPC-only mount spells (e.g. 46224, Mandokir's 23243) keep their behaviour.
-- Coupled release: client patch v7 mirrors EffectBasePoints[1] of the 11 spells and the
-- AuraDescription of all 465 spells (builds/cli295-riding/evidence/manifest/client-rows-295.tsv).
-- Replay-safe: the backup takes only rows with an old text; the updates check the old values;
-- the tail asserts the end state.
-- Rollback (exact SQL; spell_template_bak_295 stays for a later cleanup):
--   UPDATE `spell_template` s JOIN `spell_template_bak_295` b ON b.`entry` = s.`entry`
--      SET s.`effectBasePoints2` = b.`effectBasePoints2`, s.`auraDescription` = b.`auraDescription`
--    WHERE s.`effectApplyAuraName1` = 78;

